{
 "about": "Scenarios of tools/goldens/scenario_results.py (wr1 t05, t07): each runs a test program so that it writes its outputs into <out>, for the parent-versus-commit diff of tools/goldens/behaviour_check.py (the behaviour check since wr1 t07 removed the stored derived goldens). Fields: name; row (docs/status/golden-inventory.md); test (ctest entry giving the program and working directory) or argv0; args (<src>, <build>, <out> placeholders); outputs (files written into <out>); extra (more outputs); system (the column a non-CRC output difference is charged to; Behaviour: names it); systems (output -> system); needs (foc, gpu); env; drop (globs of written files that are not results); ignore (regexes of text lines not compared); nightly (left out of the landing check, run by the nightly gate); workers (the count a normal run uses) and workers_arg (the option that sets it; behaviour_check.py workers varies it); key_paths (repo paths outside engine/ the result depends on); fingerprint (args of a command whose output is an input identity, e.g. the installed mod's data).",
